sequenceDiagram
    participant J as Background Job
    participant E as Extraction Agent
    participant V as Validators
    participant A as Attribution Logic
    participant DB as Postgres
    J->>E: Extract line items
    E-->>J: Structured line items
    J->>V: Validate values and periods
    V-->>J: Issues
    alt Issues and iteration < 3
        J->>A: Map issues to source tables
        A-->>J: Correction notes
        J->>E: Retry extraction with correction addendum
    else No issues or iteration = 3
        J->>DB: Persist survivors and validation errors
    end
